SUMMARY:[SPLASH 2026 (OOPSLA)] Volunteer Application Deadline
DESCRIPTION:The page states that everyone is welcome to apply\, with prior
 ity given to junior members of the community (full- or part-time students
  of computer science and related fields). Volunteers receive a compliment
 ary conference registration covering all open sessions and proceedings\, 
 free lunches/refreshments during breaks\, a volunteer shirt\, and free ad
 mission to social events. They are responsible for their own travel and a
 ccommodation. To apply\, one must send an email to thalakottur.m@northeas
 tern.edu\, robert.zhang@utexas.edu\, or hnzhu@ucdavis.edu if they have qu
 estions\, though the page also provides a direct link to apply.\n\nExtrac
 ted automatically by a small language model\; please cross-check against 
